title: "APGI System: Allostatic Precision-Gated Ignition — testing and simulation platform"
abstract: >-
  Testing, simulation and analysis platform for the Allostatic Precision-Gated
  Ignition (APGI) framework. Ships the APGI protocol specification 1.1.0
  (eight pre-registered experimental protocols, Protocol 0-7) used by
  apgi-framework 1.1.0.
